#
# Retired EXECUTED check-set digests — the content identity of a historical pin.
#
# Added 2026-08-23, and the reason is a gap this file had all along: every retired pin was
# recorded by its COMMIT (`retired_ref*` below) and by the digest of what the oracle SOURCE
# declared, but never by the digest of what a run EXECUTED — which is the one anchor a
# published per-peer number is actually measured against. So the retired 740-check set
# existed in the tree only as the 8-hex prefix `8537d875…` quoted in prose, with no full
# value anywhere. Recovered by recomputing it from the committed per-peer reports that are
# still at that set; 26 peers agree byte-for-byte, which is stronger provenance than the
# original record would have been. The 682 and 645 values come from the same recomputation
# (4 peers and 1 peer respectively). Format matches the live field: sha256 over the sorted
# `<category>/<name>` list a `--profile core` run emitted.
retired_core_executed_check_set_digest_5 = c34abcae04c4a1ba4720dc1d693f5fd63424530ec67f04acc8c1270432832fac   # 758 checks (f313028, with -reference-peer)
retired_core_executed_check_set_digest_4 = d30c3dd0d4a19dded4471d526aed2a26c220298daa6aa77b0945114dbe65b2cb   # 756 checks (f313028, pre -reference-peer)
retired_core_executed_check_set_digest_3 = 95edd774f4a2d795dd41d90ba386004892ef34912ef38c69596a2c7f3e6f864f   # 755 checks (c1b0708)
retired_core_executed_check_set_digest   = 8537d875375145831bbda0cb4ea3279ec9f93ef87ba1df21f7aacf1af0124bf1   # 740 checks
retired_core_executed_check_set_digest_1 = ccfd87e82c3e91c76275c251e35508b43821d6903f8e1ede34da8c7ea76aad31   # 682 checks
retired_core_executed_check_set_digest_2 = 982d23dd02efd178e632fb103e461e7b5a7528b345643f45595e5a998dc6a8f1   # 645 checks
# guide_conformance is a READ MARKER, not a conformance claim — the same
# vendored-versus-consumed split spec-data uses. It asserts "this revision has been read
# and its obligations enumerated", never "implemented". GATED by tools/pin-gate.py check 5
# since 2026-09-16; before that NOTHING read this line, and the cost was the 0.8.2.19
# plural-carrier rename reaching 0 of 46 peers with nothing able to report it. Peers derive
# their whole §7a conformance scaffolding from this file; do not advance the digest to
# silence the gate — read the diff, enumerate what it owes, record the debt, then advance.
